      "statement": "HO-3 editions 2011-05 and 2018-09 condition Coverage A replacement-cost settlement on the dwelling being insured to at least 80 percent of its replacement cost at the time of loss; 2018-09 A.3 additionally makes that baseline subject to A.4 roof-surfacing provisions, and neither A.3 states a below-threshold settlement formula.",
