      "statement": "For a HO-3 edition 2018-09 policy, A.4 settles windstorm- or hail-caused roof-surfacing loss at replacement cost unless an actual-cash-value roof schedule endorsement is attached; only an attached endorsement governs settlement for roof surfacing, while all other dwelling components continue under A.3.",
