      "statement": "An attached HO 23 74 edition 2018-09 settles roof surfacing damaged by windstorm or hail at actual cash value by applying its R.3 depreciation schedule to replacement cost at the time of loss and then subtracting the applicable deductible; roof surfacing damaged by any other covered peril remains replacement cost and is outside the endorsement.",
