    {
      "id": "claim_a44d5da43e3147299db5e251d080413c",
      "statement": "HO 23 74 edition 2018-09 R.3 sets the wind/hail roof-surfacing payable percentage by material and loss-date age: composition shingle 100/80/60/40/25 percent across under-5, 5–9, 10–14, 15–19, and 20-or-more-year bands; architectural shingle, metal, and tile 100/80/60/40 percent across under-10, 10–19, 20–29, and 30-or-more-year bands; and wood shake 100/70/40 percent across under-5, 5–9, and 10-or-more-year bands.",
      "evidence": [
